{
  "category": "reflection-stories",
  "title": "To Stay",
  "slug": "to-stay",
  "publishedAt": "2026-05-14T10:00:00.000Z",
  "draft": false,
  "excerpt": "“What if one day I become completely different? Would you still love me?” And years later, she noticed how love must keep getting to know who we are becoming.",
  "body": {
    "type": "root",
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Once, she asked him,"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "“What if one day I become completely different? Would you still love me?”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "He smiled softly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "“You’re already changing all the time.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "She didn’t understand what he meant then."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "But years later, she noticed it herself."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "She no longer laughed the way she used to."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The dreams that once felt so important had changed."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Even the things that hurt her were different now."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "And somewhere along the way, she realized something quiet and almost heartbreaking:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "We do not stay the same person for very long."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Life changes us slowly."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Love changes us."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Loss changes us."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Time changes us."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "And maybe real love is not finding someone who loves you exactly as you are today."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Maybe it’s finding someone willing to keep getting to know you —"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "again and again."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Someone who notices who you are becoming…"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "and chooses to stay anyway."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
